id: flash-input-kbdrag
section: Flash
item: With the keyboard up for an engaged movie (the double tap), the movie still takes touches: a drag on it reaches it as moves, a tap as a down and an up
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect number n-down 1 1
pause 800
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 2500
# T-576 (2026-11-14): the games round double-taps a drag game, and no drag after it reached the daemon
drag 120 300 360 200 600
wait settled 5
expect number n-move 5 400
# and the drag back right after it (Raft Wars by hand, 2026-11-14: the second came as a press of 88 ms, no moves)
drag 360 200 120 300 500
wait settled 5
expect number n-move 14 800
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 300 100
expect flash-at 300 100 8
